        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-307",
          "ruleIndex": 1,
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Per-user daily ticket cap, meant to stop seed shopping, is bypassed with disposable anonymous accounts and claim_run_ticket.\n\n008 caps tickets per user per day so abandoning runs to shop for a seed has a bound, but start-run issues tickets to anonymous Supabase users too, and claim_run_ticket moves any guest's ticket to a real account. The target cap only counts tickets whose original created_at is within one day and the caller can claim only the best seed, so the bound does not hold across many guest identities.\n\nImpact: Integrity of the leaderboard: the server-issued random seed no longer constrains seed selection, so top scores can be farmed by seed shopping. No data disclosure or account takeover.\n\nExploit scenario: Attacker scripts signInAnonymously repeatedly, calls start-run up to 30 times per guest (tickets and seeds are returned to the client), replays the public game engine offline to find which seeds score best, then calls claim-run-ticket with that guest's token to move only the winning ticket to their real account and submits a run for it. Tickets older than a day do not count against the target's cap, and tickets never expire.\n\nPreconditions: Supabase anonymous sign-ins are enabled (the web app calls signInAnonymously); Attacker can create many anonymous sessions (limited only by Supabase's per-IP auth rate limit); Per-IP throttling in the edge functions is off unless TRUSTED_CLIENT_IP_HEADER is set.\n\nRecommendation: Do not issue tickets to anonymous users beyond a small global cap, or enforce an issuance cap keyed by something anonymous sessions cannot multiply. Give tickets an expiry and make claim_run_ticket reject tickets older than the window. Count claimed tickets against the target using a claimed_at timestamp.\n\nCWE-799. Severity LOW, confidence medium."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "supabase/migrations/009_anonymous_guests.sql",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 46,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  update public.run_tickets set user_id = p_to_user"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
