        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-287",
          "ruleIndex": 2,
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Free-tier daily run cap enforced only from client localStorage; server grants up to 30 tickets/day to everyone.\n\nThe 3-runs-per-day gate that HomeScreen turns into dailyLimitReached is computed from the user-writable localStorage key rep_daily_runs, so deleting or editing the key (or patching the JS) resets it. start-run/issue_run_ticket applies the same DAILY_TICKET_LIMIT=30 to every user regardless of entitlement, so the server never enforces the free cap.\n\nImpact: Bypass of a monetization gate (unlimited daily runs without full_access). No confidentiality loss, and ranked saves stay bounded by the server cap of 30 tickets/day.\n\nExploit scenario: A non-paying user clears or rewrites rep_daily_runs in DevTools before each launch. The UI never shows the daily-limit paywall, so they start unlimited runs. start-run keeps issuing tickets up to the server cap of 30/day and submit-run saves them, so the premium benefit of unlimited runs is obtained without full_access.\n\nPreconditions: Attacker has a browser and can edit localStorage or the client bundle; The 3/day cap is meant as a paid-tier restriction.\n\nRecommendation: If the cap is a real entitlement, enforce it in start-run/issue_run_ticket with a lower daily limit for users without full_access and keep the localStorage counter as a UI hint only.\n\nCWE-602. Severity LOW, confidence medium."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "apps/web/src/hooks/useEntitlements.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 24,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "return Math.max(0, 3 - d.count);"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "getDailyRunsRemaining",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "getDailyRunsRemaining"
                }
